WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:03,530
Can be synthesized from clay remote furnace

2
00:00:03,530 --> 00:00:16,960
From now on, there is no need to carry a few plastic bottles and run three kilometers every day.

3
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:17,960
Talk about the key points

4
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:18,960
I can bring you people who can do the work

5
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:20,960
