6
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:21,960
I can get her to come over

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:22,960
Then what?

8
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,960
I don't want money

9
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,960
Don’t eat once or twice

10
00:00:24,960 --> 00:00:25,960
I just want your promise

11
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,960
As long as I'm valuable to you

12
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:27,960
Just don't let me starve to death

13
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:28,960
Big appetite

14
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,400
So let me show my sincerity first

15
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,400
let me see first

16
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,400
How much ability do you have?

17
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,400
